{"steam_appid":3575300,"steam_name":"Climb The Backrooms","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3575300/1042851025/543ebe9a43f3588cac96895158114552f8b46035/1750430649/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750910944","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257149345/3daca2adf80bd683758e2c8dfbf3125e2b544b50/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750910944","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/42b42573e1e5ab29849435937e19d1966ec70d3f/ss_42b42573e1e5ab29849435937e19d1966ec70d3f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779846262","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/f3ddde37b2f365c6a776a5bd590c999c5143f734/ss_f3ddde37b2f365c6a776a5bd590c999c5143f734.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779846262","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/d17951fbe49ee165562342ae8278f68d2ff1625c/ss_d17951fbe49ee165562342ae8278f68d2ff1625c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779846262","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/8ea853c6808136c8a929b8a7995c3a3037925c5c/ss_8ea853c6808136c8a929b8a7995c3a3037925c5c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779846262","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/c62bb0425a720dc488bc8417a507c881c723702d/ss_c62bb0425a720dc488bc8417a507c881c723702d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779846262"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/874c98b91fe2ff59ca9f900bc4494ab8.webp?t=1779846262\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend through the twisted levels of the Backrooms using <strong>physics-based object manipulation</strong> to overcome obstacles, <strong>solve mind-bending puzzles</strong>, and <strong>uncover unsettling secrets</strong>. Play solo or team up in <strong>online co-op with up to 4 players</strong> as you climb higher, think smarter, and survive the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/0683025f1e4dff86b8e7f5f3eb83ea77.poster.avif?t=1779846262\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/0683025f1e4dff86b8e7f5f3eb83ea77.webm?t=1779846262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/0683025f1e4dff86b8e7f5f3eb83ea77.mp4?t=1779846262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/2bc2a7d3d96b2dbc85f06eaf08b1ef12.webp?t=1779846262\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up with up to 3 others in online co-op!</strong> Work together to <strong>solve puzzles, move objects, and survive the horrors</strong> that lurk in the shadows. Or go solo for a truly intense experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/6e18d3f4b473365e5e5d3ab893842308.poster.avif?t=1779846262\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/6e18d3f4b473365e5e5d3ab893842308.webm?t=1779846262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/6e18d3f4b473365e5e5d3ab893842308.mp4?t=1779846262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/53c98a40c93cc03b43929b3b23be6ee6.webp?t=1779846262\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your mind to overcome more than just physical obstacles. <strong>Decrypt riddles, unlock paths, and outsmart the strange logic of the backrooms</strong> to continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575300/extras/6cf4ec0981b94f4e13bbd1c560bb737a.webp?t=1779846262\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You're not alone.</i></strong> Watch your back as you encounter lurking threats in the dark. Outsmart them, outrun them, or find a way to fight—but remember: they’re always watching.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit version 1909 revision .1350<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4430<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 11 (Latest Feature Update)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual"],"developers":["LovDEV"],"publishers":["LovDEV"],"release_date":"11 Jul, 2025"}